# Bundled dye library for IMP.bff. Converted from the FRETpredict CSV tables
# (PRD-113): CIF is the data format for this package.
# The _bff_dye and _bff_dye_spectrum categories are bff-native. No dictionary in
# the stack -- mmCIF std, PDBx v50/v5_next, DDL, MA, IHM, IHM-FLR, mmfdb FLR and
# workflow extensions -- defines an item for a quantum yield, an extinction
# coefficient or a spectrum; the only matches are
# _em_detector.detective_quantum_efficiency and the NMR spectral categories.
# These items should be proposed for mmfdb_flr_ext.dic. Identifiers follow
# flrCIF: chromophore_name is _flr_probe_list.chromophore_name.
data_bff_dye_library
#
